@name     data_slice_to_args
@alias    ds>a
@group    data
@c_name   skode_clause_data_slice_to_args
@type     immediate
@arity    2
@match    (finite, finite)
@summary  replace argument list with a slice of the data array
@doc
Usage: start count ds>a word
Replaces the argument list with count values of the data array starting at start.
@code
    return skode_exec_d_slice_to_args(ctx, s, args, argc);
@end
